  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/g2WTZPdr/More-Concrete-Banner.png\" alt=\"Banner\"></p>\n<h1><strong>更多混凝土 (Fabric / Forge / NeoForge)</strong></h1>\n<p>一个简单的模组，为 Minecraft 添加了更多混凝土变体！</p>\n<h5><strong>NeoForge 版本适用于 Minecraft 1.20.4 及更高版本！</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>Fabric 版本适用于 Minecraft 1.21.1、1.21.4 及以上版本！</strong></h5>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/VN4fyWBR/More-Concrete-Break.png\" alt=\"Break\"></p>\n<h3><strong>✅ 功能特性</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>混凝土台阶、楼梯、墙、杠杆、压力板、栅栏、栅栏门和按钮！</li>\n<li>兼容资源包</li>\n<li>方块可通过工作台制作，部分方块可通过切石机制作</li>\n<li>所有素材均由模组自动生成</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/VN4fyWBR/More-Concrete-Break.png\" alt=\"Break\"></p>\n<h3><strong>🔨 合成配方</strong></h3>\n<p>合成配方与原版配方相同，但需要使用混凝土方块。\n安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI)</a> 以在游戏中查看所有合成配方。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/VN4fyWBR/More-Concrete-Break.png\" alt=\"Break\"></p>\n<h3><strong>📷 图片展示</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/kGs3S1VR/More-Concrete-Image.png\" alt=\"Image\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/4xBp00kL/More-Concrete-Image-Redstone-Update.png\" alt=\"Image\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/VN4fyWBR/More-Concrete-Break.png\" alt=\"Break\"></p>\n<h3><strong>🔖 热门版本链接</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-concrete/files/all?version=26.1.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 26.1.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-concrete/files/all?version=1.21.11\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.11</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-concrete/files/all?version=1.21.8\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-concrete/files/all?version=1.21.5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-concrete/files/all?version=1.21.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-concrete/files/all?version=1.21.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-concrete/files/all?version=1.20.6\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.20.6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-concrete/files/all?version=1.20.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.20.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-concrete/files/all?version=1.20.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.20.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-concrete/files/all?version=1.19.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.19.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-concrete/files/all?version=1.19.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.19.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-concrete/files/all?version=1.18.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.18.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-concrete/files/all?version=1.17.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.17.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-concrete/files/all?version=1.16.5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.16.5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-concrete/files/all?version=1.15.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.15.2</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/VN4fyWBR/More-Concrete-Break.png\" alt=\"Break\"></p>\n<h3><strong>ℹ 更多信息</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>请将问题和错误报告提交到 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/MoreConcrete/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 上的问题追踪器</a>！</li>\n<li>我可以将你的模组收录到我的整合包中吗？当然可以！</li>\n<li>可以提交翻译吗？可以的，请在 GitHub 上创建一个 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/MoreConcrete/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pull Request（拉取请求）</a>！</li>\n<li>访问 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/MoreConcrete/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Concrete Wiki</a> 以获取有关此模组功能的更多信息。</li>\n<li>Fabric 用户请注意：此模组的 Fabric 版本需要作为模组安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/VN4fyWBR/More-Concrete-Break.png\" alt=\"Break\"></p>\n<h3><strong>💬 加入我的 Discord 服务器</strong></h3>\n<p><em><a href=\"https://discord.gg/KP3BBatuw5\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我的 Discord 服务器</a> 以获取模组更新、模组支持等最新资讯！</em></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/VN4fyWBR/More-Concrete-Break.png\" alt=\"Break\"></p>\n<h4><strong>⚠️ 免责声明</strong></h4>\n<p>本模组仅通过 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-concrete\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-concrete\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/MoreConcrete/releases\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方 GitHub 仓库</a> 分发。\n请勿重新分发此模组 <em>或</em> 从其他下载源下载此模组。</p>\n<p>有关模组重传（reposts）的更多详情以及如何保护自己免受其害，请访问：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstopmodreposts.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">stopmodreposts.org</a>。</p>",
